s with its intense, lap-based gameplay across 11 unique levels. In this immersive experience, players can enjoy a variety of challenging courses, including 8 off-road tracks and 3 thrilling stadium circuits. Each level is carefully designed to provide a realistic and adrenaline-pumping journey, whether you're navigating through rugged, obstacle-ridden trails or speeding through professional racing arenas.\n\nThe off-road levels push players to their limits, featuring diverse terrains, unexpected turns, and natural obstacles that demand skillful handling and quick reflexes. In contrast, the stadium tracks offer high-speed action within a controlled environment, where precision and agility are key. ScootExtreme VR combines cutting-edge VR technology with responsive mechanics, creating a fully immersive racing experience where every lap feels like a true adventure. Perfect for VR enthusiasts and racing fans, ScootExtreme VR is where the thrill of off-road riding meets the excitement of competitive racing, all in the virtual world.", "short_description": "ScootExtreme VR is an immersive VR racing game with 11 unique levels featuring intense lap-based challenges. Ride through 8 thrilling off-road courses filled with rugged terrains and obstacles, or race in 3 electrifying stadium levels designed for high-speed competition. Get ready to experience fast-paced action and realistic environments, perfect for VR enthusiasts and racing fans alike."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.flyingshrimpsgames.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Flying Shrimps Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.flyingshrimpsgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "ext